## Why This Is Asked

Tests practical, scalable moderation system design balancing latency, privacy, explainability, and governance across multilingual environments with live policy updates and comprehensive auditability.

## Key Concepts

- On-device vs cloud inference and data locality
- Policy-as-code with versioning and hot-reload capabilities
- Counterfactual explanations for decision transparency
- Privacy-preserving updates and tenant isolation
- Drift detection and comprehensive auditing

